        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Velocity Retro Horizon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about the destination. Here, only the journey matters. Your journey is a symphony of speed and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the most atmospheric racing experience, where every drive is an immersion into a living, breathing world of retro-futurism. You'll find yourself behind the wheel of iconic 80s cars, from polished supercars to bold hatchbacks, cutting through an endless highway bathed in the glow of neon lights and giant cyber holograms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's a soul to this world. It's a deafening, custom-made synthwave soundtrack that's not just a backdrop, but the driving force behind your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/f9bc7e91435d1402f746f38040589989.poster.avif?t=1768477233\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/f9bc7e91435d1402f746f38040589989.webm?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/f9bc7e91435d1402f746f38040589989.mp4?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEEL THE RHYTHM OF THE ROAD:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic audioscape: Our soundtrack lives and breathes with you. A gentle turn adds an ambient pad, a sharp acceleration triggers a powerful arpeggiator, and a long straight brings the music to a dazzling drop. You don't just listen—you play the soundtrack with your steering wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound you can touch: Pulsating bass becomes the beat of your engine. Drum rolls synchronize with the flashing neon signs. Every note is a part of this world, creating a complete synesthesia of sound and vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original tracks from masters of the genre: We collaborated with talented modern synthwave composers to create a unique musical palette that will transport you straight to the heart of the 80s, as they were meant to be. From melancholy melodies for late-night solo rides to explosive compositions for sprints at the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/ba465dd55af07c6d640c88c6f919b08a.poster.avif?t=1768477233\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/ba465dd55af07c6d640c88c6f919b08a.webm?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/ba465dd55af07c6d640c88c6f919b08a.mp4?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Highway: An algorithmically generated track ensures that every ride is unique. Urban canyons, deserted highways under the stars, mountain serpentines with views of the metropolis—the world changes to the rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/23cdd1cf9946bc32665674f6b2b084ba.poster.avif?t=1768477233\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/23cdd1cf9946bc32665674f6b2b084ba.webm?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/23cdd1cf9946bc32665674f6b2b084ba.mp4?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream Garage: A collection of meticulously crafted cars from the era, each with not only unique handling characteristics but also its own distinctive sound within a shared musical canvas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Paradise: Immerse yourself in a visual masterpiece inspired by the aesthetics of VHS, anime, and Art Deco. A paradoxical world where the future is yesterday, and it's beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules-Free Journey: No leaderboards, no pressure. Just merge with the road, tune the radio to your station, and discover the peace of speed. Or challenge yourself in special &quot;Musical Challenges,&quot; where the perfection of a track depends on your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn up the volume. Open the window. Feel the wind. Let the wave of nostalgia and the powerful soundtrack carry you beyond the horizon, into a world where you'll forever be one with the road and the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS Velocity Retro Horizon isn't just a game. It's your personal musical journey through time and space.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Velocity Retro Horizon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about the destination. Here, only the journey matters. Your journey is a symphony of speed and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the most atmospheric racing experience, where every drive is an immersion into a living, breathing world of retro-futurism. You'll find yourself behind the wheel of iconic 80s cars, from polished supercars to bold hatchbacks, cutting through an endless highway bathed in the glow of neon lights and giant cyber holograms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's a soul to this world. It's a deafening, custom-made synthwave soundtrack that's not just a backdrop, but the driving force behind your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/f9bc7e91435d1402f746f38040589989.poster.avif?t=1768477233\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/f9bc7e91435d1402f746f38040589989.webm?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/f9bc7e91435d1402f746f38040589989.mp4?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEEL THE RHYTHM OF THE ROAD:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic audioscape: Our soundtrack lives and breathes with you. A gentle turn adds an ambient pad, a sharp acceleration triggers a powerful arpeggiator, and a long straight brings the music to a dazzling drop. You don't just listen—you play the soundtrack with your steering wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound you can touch: Pulsating bass becomes the beat of your engine. Drum rolls synchronize with the flashing neon signs. Every note is a part of this world, creating a complete synesthesia of sound and vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original tracks from masters of the genre: We collaborated with talented modern synthwave composers to create a unique musical palette that will transport you straight to the heart of the 80s, as they were meant to be. From melancholy melodies for late-night solo rides to explosive compositions for sprints at the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/ba465dd55af07c6d640c88c6f919b08a.poster.avif?t=1768477233\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/ba465dd55af07c6d640c88c6f919b08a.webm?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/ba465dd55af07c6d640c88c6f919b08a.mp4?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Highway: An algorithmically generated track ensures that every ride is unique. Urban canyons, deserted highways under the stars, mountain serpentines with views of the metropolis—the world changes to the rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/23cdd1cf9946bc32665674f6b2b084ba.poster.avif?t=1768477233\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/23cdd1cf9946bc32665674f6b2b084ba.webm?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125390/extras/23cdd1cf9946bc32665674f6b2b084ba.mp4?t=1768477233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream Garage: A collection of meticulously crafted cars from the era, each with not only unique handling characteristics but also its own distinctive sound within a shared musical canvas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Paradise: Immerse yourself in a visual masterpiece inspired by the aesthetics of VHS, anime, and Art Deco. A paradoxical world where the future is yesterday, and it's beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules-Free Journey: No leaderboards, no pressure. Just merge with the road, tune the radio to your station, and discover the peace of speed. Or challenge yourself in special &quot;Musical Challenges,&quot; where the perfection of a track depends on your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn up the volume. Open the window. Feel the wind. Let the wave of nostalgia and the powerful soundtrack carry you beyond the horizon, into a world where you'll forever be one with the road and the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS Velocity Retro Horizon isn't just a game. It's your personal musical journey through time and space.</p>",
